{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "03d88f9b0c01a8ba761f63eceaaf0d36416b1722e6d87a94cbbdfb8030dfd987", "ja": "テキスト無し", "zh": "无文本", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "2e34788e4661680ff4e76a1a2b96c6165b7c54a4d3254b188065a39ce83da747", "ja": "『Clover』単独ライブ　当日", "zh": "“Clover”独创演出　当天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "3338f5aa96b79fb46f91b4e8ee76cf395340cbc7f7aca1d3357d67f85261041f", "ja": "志保ちゃん！\nりっくんとお母さん、もう会場着いたって～♪", "zh": "志保！\n小陆和妈妈已经到会场了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "3543ac5479e587d996b7d6e573b7e10355b9f1086ef0c8702443a539ad246090", "ja": "え？　どうして可奈が知ってるの？\n私にはまだ何も……。", "zh": "诶？可奈怎么会知道？\n我这边还什么都没收到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "b888c81aa1a39c4779dcc61e7578d873d65c07e18bb8916395b14e0c694091f6", "ja": "環ちゃんからのメッセージ！\nりっくん達を案内してくれてるんだよ♪", "zh": "来自小环的消息！\n她正在给小陆他们带路呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "059c9bd81577c02b5f192f582137810c1874d72a0347f3fa3901bc8558dab694", "ja": "そうなの。じゃあ、あとでお礼言わないと。\nあ……、りっくんからも来たわ。", "zh": "是这样啊。那之后得去道谢才行。\n啊……小律那边也发消息过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "85f258239da68e445a98e8b6822f6cb6967b4fdb0c9fb3d507b8bf77785a2695", "ja": "うちもお姉ちゃんが来てくれるんだ～☆\nせりりんも、おうちの人が来るんだよね？", "zh": "我家姐姐也会来哦～☆\n星梨花家里也有人要来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1b3163790f3e695e765c9294f9fcd2d72e93f2c91e56c305312580ded5d796e", "ja": "はい♪　パパがわたしの名前のうちわを\n作ってくれたって言ってました！", "zh": "是的♪爸爸说，他给我做了写着我名字的扇子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "316d12a20b28173dc48b3b01a4110b5dcc6c6e002749514317d44d1b2b2d0039", "ja": "わぁ、本格的！\nパパさんかわいい☆　かわいい～♪", "zh": "哇，好专业！\n令尊好可爱☆　好可爱哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "bdfb51f9f3a0c736b45d9fb7955e7c00baf35883e7f219174a0df8e2bc2d376b", "ja": "あ。合唱部のみんなは、もう着いたかな？\nもう会場にいるのかな～？", "zh": "啊，合唱部的大家已经到了吗？\n已经在会场里了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1010_405bcp", "source_sha256": "2fdbd75367dfffff6b28a9991fd9f41afe61e6750a2e0dea820501a0e5327c3d", "ja": "気になるだろうけど、もうかなりお客さんが入ってる。\n会場を覗きに行ったりするんじゃないぞ。", "zh": "虽然你会在意，不过现场已经进了不少客人。别跑去会场偷看啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "e1eaf3b02365ecea162fd287c1561fdab37de991173b6ea537885dbc425f93e9", "ja": "はぅ！　わ、わかりました～！", "zh": "啊！我、我知道了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "1e7825a04bbce1b5455045e21d0fc46df308bdf03c4fc10ae23f043049267c85", "ja": "でも、なんかすごいよね！　今日のお客さん、みんな\n私達4人を見に来てくれたってことでしょ？", "zh": "不过，感觉真的很厉害呢！今天的观众，都是来看我们4个人的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f41be6d986012038efa7c6ec2ce3db163b05e8be7cc7f25577f1d6df331295c", "ja": "『Clover』初めての、単独ライブ……！\nもうすぐ始まるのに、なんだかまだ信じられません。", "zh": "“Clover”的第一次单独演出……！\n明明马上就要开始了，总觉得还是有点难以置信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "987634b3737854f7c42325cbd9b4d1bc17f8bf649e7d37fa07a403a09f3a4c61", "ja": "そうね。私もまだ不思議な気持ち。\n遠回りもしたし、間違えたこともあったけど……。", "zh": "是啊，我也还是觉得不可思议。\n我们也走过弯路，也犯过错……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "849e9762fef4e8b52fa2aaf8bb3a08c6dc119f866ec0ecc284e8458e17393cdf", "ja": "でも、私達はここまで来れたの。\n……みんなが、助けてくれたから。", "zh": "但是，我们还是走到了今天。\n……因为有大家的帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "6652f2b5991ca8b15c5fb38daebd525256dc8ef7f6cb74669afa57dec304f2fc", "ja": "しほりん……。", "zh": "志保……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "8f81090c5002a4c1c6e807319d87bb258bcfad278c56dff40b58e971f8f98153", "ja": "私は、特に志保ちゃんのおかげ！　最初の頃は私、\n失敗ばっかりで、志保ちゃんを怒らせちゃって……。", "zh": "特别要感谢志保！刚开始的时候我总是失败，还惹得志保生气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "500feb0d1548623ec0cbf16d1e035118cf1a4097183dc349f5594de19dcaa21a", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……あったけど。\n最初の頃は私も、いろいろ余裕がなかったから。", "zh": "没、没那回事……虽然确实有过。\n刚开始的时候，我也因为各种事情焦头烂额，没什么余裕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "60f93ac034c9d85b1e312eb0c9214ceead6676f8b09745dd05517f73edfdb75c", "ja": "でも、可奈の失敗は今もじゃなかった？", "zh": "可是，可奈的失败不就是现在也有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "658dc75e3e043ed742adb8a5e6ad21d5d9114b2c97cb6174bbd465c7f53658fb", "ja": "あ、ひどーい！\n今日は大丈夫だもん！　たぶん！", "zh": "啊，好过分——！\n我今天没问题啦！大概！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "0c861572ba3c5e52c8c5358ad6cb604dabffc65bb30b5e5c8f646d069ae6e07a", "ja": "たぶん……。まぁ、いいわ。\n一緒に頑張りましょう。", "zh": "大概吧……算了。\n一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "b6bef76e49eee4e6730fe7be6f4c8c544db85bd1b4a9ff6dea0fb236032eb9de", "ja": "うん♪　Cloverで一緒に、ゴーゴゴー♪", "zh": "嗯♪　Clover一起，冲冲冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "18f259c468a939c10b9f9394349a7ee2026e37c215ed16098f4ff2801ec0e825", "ja": "ふふっ。可奈さんと志保さん、\n今日もとっても仲良しさんですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，可奈小姐和志保小姐，今天也关系非常好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1024_405bcp", "source_sha256": "db562732860f6a8012ed70e5430e6c8d17cb285a90014803af1783110397f025", "ja": "ま、だいぶマシにはなったな。\n最初はかなりアレだったけど。", "zh": "嗯，已经好很多了。\n刚开始真是挺糟糕的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f52e051a4f9e8cfba7d903aea842e5b630d597704fee4dcfdc807e08ef5fd8e", "ja": "アレ？", "zh": "哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "d285ec5a53faca01b6c4f8a3871f54c99fb14bd0207b4c99795210b412c75ae1", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとびっくりしただけです。\n初対面で聞いた歌が……アレだったので。", "zh": "只、只是稍微吓了一跳而已。  \n因为第一次见面时听到的歌……是那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "0f52e051a4f9e8cfba7d903aea842e5b630d597704fee4dcfdc807e08ef5fd8e", "ja": "アレ？", "zh": "哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "04a59923639ffd8dedf8b6d9eda4504e62cbaa23865f9a78f88ec442387cc87a", "ja": "あ、せりりんはあの日いなかったもんね！", "zh": "啊，星梨花那天不在嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_intro_1029_405bcp", "source_sha256": "2d6f022001c824e92cb511b2be3a14e287150203eb5980cbb6d18fb10d4802d0", "ja": "可奈が歌ったんだ。\n初めて劇場に来た、あの日もな……。", "zh": "是可奈唱的。就连第一次来到剧场的那天，她也唱过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
